WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.584 --> 00:00:18.764
Bonjour ! Quel âge as-tu, Adrien ?
Hello! How old are you, Adrien?

2
00:00:18.864 --> 00:00:21.284
J'ai vingt ans.
I'm twenty years old.

3
00:00:21.384 --> 00:00:24.764
Et ton numéro de téléphone ?
And your phone number?

4
00:00:24.864 --> 00:00:31.724
C'est le zéro six, douze, trente-quatre, cinquante-six, soixante-dix-huit.
It's 06 12 34 56 78.

5
00:00:31.824 --> 00:00:36.596
Et ton e-mail ? Ça s'écrit comment ?
And your e-mail? How do you spell it?

6
00:00:36.696 --> 00:00:42.212
A-D-R-I-E-N, arobase, mail, point, com.
A-D-R-I-E-N, at, mail, dot, com.

7
00:00:42.312 --> 00:00:45.452
Parfait, merci !
Perfect, thank you!
